   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Auditing REMA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision REMA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen ifr&#xe5;ga &#xe4;r en finansiell revision av Rwandan Environment Management Agencys (REMA) . Revisionen upphandlas av ambasasden inf&#xf6;r n&#xe4;sta utbetalning, eftersom REMA inte granskats av Rwandas Office of Auditor General sedan projektet inleddes 2011. Revisionen omfattar perioden februari 2011-juni 2014. Noteras b&#xf6;r att inga utbetalning gjordes till REMA under 2012, d&#xe5; Sveriges stat-till-stat-bist&#xe5;nd till Rwanda var suspenderat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution(51160089) aims at engaging Price WaterhouseCoopers   AB to conduct annual auditing to REMA. The GoS through its Embassy in Kigali is suppoting REMA to implement the ENR Programme/Environment &amp; Climate Change Component in Rwanda. The auditing of REMA support has  become necessay due to that the annual auditing report, which was     supposed to be prepared by the OAG was not fulfilled as per agreement</narrative>
  </description>
